                "type": "math",
                "latex": "\\begin{align*}v&=u+at\\\\v&=\\frac{100}{3.6}\\ \\frac{\\mathrm{m}}{\\mathrm{s}}\\\\v&=\\frac{250}{9}\\ \\frac{\\mathrm{m}}{\\mathrm{s}}\\\\\\frac{250}{9}&=0+7a\\\\a&=\\frac{250}{63}\\ \\frac{\\mathrm{m}}{\\mathrm{s}^2}\\\\a&\\approx3.97\\ \\frac{\\mathrm{m}}{\\mathrm{s}^2}\\end{align*}",
